# TESTAMENTARY RENUNCIATION AND TESTAMENTARY ASSIGNMENT: A COMPARISON TO LAWS OF FOREIGN COUNTRIES

**Authors:** O. A. Madygina, Svetlana N. Abroshina

## Abstract
In this article, the author presents a comparative legal description of the institutions of hereditary law: probate refusal and probate assignment in national and foreign legislation. The author also analyzed the defi nition and legal essence of the probate refusal and probate assignment.

